  message: "Merged as PR #2257. EVIDENCE: (1) bar/recheck_readers.py replants campaign 4's four faults on the live index: test_live_tree_is_clean 'missed before 1, kept now 1' for each, CLEAN (recheck_readers.txt). (2) After the full run of 2026-11-18 ~19:00Z (dev 55e2fbb2c, 41,394 passed), readers per changed file over campaign 4's 58 files: min 81, median 101, max 118 (was min 993, median 1,012, max 1,030 before analyzer_identity._hash_package_py_files was named hash-only); the guard test is a reader of every one (readers_after.txt). (3) test_statement_select.py pins the rule: a reader is selected for a statement change and a docstring edit, in the index's spelling, unmeasured or not; tests/test_smart_test_prose_rule.py resolves every hash-only name."  # 2f33
